\par\par \b \uc2 China Official Says Time Is Good for Outbound Investment\b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 2012\par 11:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BEIJING--Conditions are ready for Chinese companies to accelerate overseas expansion, Yi Gang, a vice governor of \uc2 China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Saturday.\par \par \uc2 China has ample capital at home and its gross domestic product per capita exceeding $5000 indicates the time has come for local firms to increase investment abroad, Mr. Yi told an economic forum in Beijing.\par \par \uc2 Also, he said a slowing global economy has brought down market valuations of foreign companies, while the yuan's two-way fluctuation is good for companies that hold huge positions in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But Chinese companies should downplay their relationship with the government when making acquisitions in overseas markets, which will make it easier for them to obtain approval from foreign regulators, said Mr. Yi.\par \par \uc2 At the forum, he also said the yuan is very close to its equilibrium level.\par \par \uc2 In the past year, China's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have stayed between $3.2 trillion and $3.3 trillion, which shows the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has reduced its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, he added.\par \par \uc2 Sentiment on \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the yuan, has turned cautious because of slowing domestic growth and the government's crackdown on the property market.\par \par \uc2 The Chinese yuan has dropped 1.3% in the year to date. It rose 3.6% and 4.7% in 2010 and 2011, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Write to Grace Zhu at grace.zhu@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires}}}\uc2  [ 21-07-12 0903GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120721e87l0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
