 and banking union within the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  zone. (published 0201 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par DATA SNAP: UK CONSUMERS STUCK IN DEEPEST FUNK FOR 40 YEARS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Britons have not been so gloomy about their prospects since records began 40 years ago, according to a survey released Friday. (published 2301 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par WSJ UPDATE: BANKING GROUP ASKS UK TO EXAMINE LIBOR PROCESS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The process for setting one of the world's most important interest rates veered toward a shake-up when the U.K. banking group responsible for the rate asked government officials to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . (published 2332 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par WSJ UPDATE: U.S. CLEARS \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CHINA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  FROM IRAN OIL SANCTIONS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.S. exempted China from penalties for doing business with Tehran as the latest set of U.S. sanctions targeting Iran's oil exports took effect on Thursday. (published 2338 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par DBS GROUP TRIPLES U.S. COMMERCIAL PAPER PROGRAM TO $15 BILLION \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 DBS Group Holdings Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Friday said the banking group has raised the size of its existing U.S. commercial paper program to $15 billion from $5 billion at present. (published 2327 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par FIRST METRO INVESTMENT TO ISSUE PHP5 BLN CORPORATE BONDS IN 2H \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The notes will be issued in one or two tranches, with a greenshoe option of up to PHP2 billion, the bank said in a filing to the Philippine Stock Exchange. (published 0232 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par AVIC INTERNATIONAL FINANCE SELLING 3-YEAR DIM SUM BONDS TODAY - SOURCE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The company has set a yield guidance of 4.84%-5.00% for the unsecured bonds, said the person, who declined to be named. (published 0336 GMT) [ 29-06-12 0400GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1030 1804 4180   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120629e86t0007j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
