\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Opens Weaker Amid  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Concerns\b0\par\par\uc2 470 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 13:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Overseas markets buoyed by Greek parliament vote on EUR130 billion rescue package\par \par \uc2 --Expectations for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Brazil likely to weigh on real trading\par \par \uc2 --Brazilian real opens trading at BRL1.8217, weaker from Tuesday's close at BRL1.8190\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     By Jeff Fick \par     Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--Concerns about further government \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets offset positive momentum in Europe's ongoing debt crisis to kick off Wednesday's session, sending the real to a weaker open against the U.S. dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real failed to join other global \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in advancing against the dollar, including a stronger euro on the news from Greece. The euro's gains boosted global commodities prices, typically a key barometer for the real. The real opened at BRL1.8217 to the greenback, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet. That was weaker from Tuesday's close at BRL1.8190\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 After global markets were waylaid the previous session by concerns about economic prospects in China, Greece's parliament yielded a dose of good news as lawmakers in the debt-troubled country approved a deal with the International Monetary Fund, European Union and European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on a EUR130 billion aid package. Now, Greek lawmakers face the unenviable task of implementing harsh austerity measures to rein in government spending.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Concerns about China's outlook for growth, however, could continue to hang over local markets. China is Brazil's leading trade partner and a key consumer of the country's iron ore and other commodities. China previously reduced its target for growth to 7.5% in 2012, down from previous year's target of 8%. In addition, mining companies \f28 \uc2 \f2 BHP Billiton Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (BHP, BHP.AU) and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Rio Tinto PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (RIO, RIO.LN) raised concerns about the pace of a slowdown in China, citing the country's apparently declining appetite for iron ore.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In Brazil, meanwhile, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remained active in the market by purchasing dollars in a spot-market auction. That is likely to limit any move by the real to strengthen in coming days, said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Banco Santander\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "Increasingly less benign prospects for commodities--given more abundant evidence of a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  slowdown--and aggressive [\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ] \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are likely to continue exerting a weakening bias on the [real], in our view," Santander said.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market players will likely keep a close eye on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  flows and data on the level of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that should shed light on the size of net inflows over the past week, Santander added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Markets will also be on the lookout for U.S. existing home sales data and a U.K budget proposal, analysts said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 --By Jeff Fick, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-21-2586-6085; Jeff.Fick@dowjones.com [ 21-03-12 1237GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120321e83l000tq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
